Cloudflare WARP on Void Linux
=============================

This package is the official Cloudflare .deb repackaged for xbps/runit.

Daemon (required):
    sudo ln -s /etc/sv/warp-svc /var/service/
    sv status warp-svc

CLI:
    warp-cli registration new      # first time only (accepts the ToS prompt)
    warp-cli connect
    warp-cli status

GUI / tray (Cloudflare One Client):
    warp-taskbar
  It lives in the system tray (StatusNotifierItem). Desktops that honour
  /etc/xdg/autostart start it on login; for sway/hyprland/i3 etc. add
  `exec warp-taskbar` to your compositor config. Your bar needs a tray
  (waybar "tray" module, swaybar, ...). Click the tray icon to open the window.
